   "slide_text": "ESDF Field + L-GFBS + 1-D QSQP Opt. (1)\nv_opt = optimize_velocity_profile(\n        Q_opt, \n        esdf_map, \n        v_target=1.0, \n        a_max=0.5, \n        a_lat_max=0.5, \n        d_safety_margin=0.6, \n        v_obstacle_limit=0.5\n    )\nw_v = 1.0  # 貼近指定速度的權重\nw_a = 5.0  # 懲罰縱向加速度的權重\ndef _add_wall_obstacles(self):\n        \"\"\"填入 Costmap 障礙物區域\"\"\"\n        x_indices = np.linspace(self.x_min, self.x_max, self.nx)\n        y_indices = np.linspace(self.y_min, self.y_max, self.ny)\n        \n        for ix, x in enumerate(x_indices):\n            for iy, y in enumerate(y_indices):\n                if 4.0 <= x <= 6.0:\n                    # 避開中間通道 y in [-0.8, 0.9]\n                    if not (-0.8 < y < 0.9):\n                        self.costmap[iy, ix] = True\n# 利用 ESDF 距離場判斷與障礙物距離\n        dist, _ = esdf_map.get_esdf_and_grad(Q_opt[i, 0], Q_opt[i, 1])\n        if dist < d_safety_margin:\n            v_max_obs = v_obstacle_limit  # 靠近障礙物時限速 (例如 0.5 m/s)\n        else:\n            v_max_obs = v_target",
