   },
   "slide_text": "DecompROS + Traj. QSQP Opt. + Speed/Accel. QSQP Opt. (1)\nv_opt = optimize_velocity_profile(\n        Q_opt, \n        corridor_boxes, \n        v_target=1.0, \n        a_max=0.5, \n        a_lat_max=0.5, \n        v_corridor_limit=0.5\n    )\nw_v = 1.0  # 貼近指定速度的權重\nw_a = 5.0   # 懲罰縱向加速度的權重\n# 下半部牆壁\n    for x in np.linspace(4.0, 6.0, 15):\n        for y in np.linspace(-1.5, -0.5, 15):\n            obs_points.append([x, y])\n    # 上半部牆壁\n    for x in np.linspace(4.0, 6.0, 15):\n        for y in np.linspace(2.2, 3.0, 10):\n            obs_points.append([x, y])\n    return np.array(obs_points)\n# 約束 2: 每個點的速度上限 q_i <= min(v_target^2, a_lat_max / kappa_i, v_corridor_limit^2)\n    for i in range(num_q):\n        A_osqp[row_idx, i] = 1.0\n        l_osqp[row_idx] = 0.0 # v^2 >= 0\n        \n        # 1. 幾何曲率限制側向加速度：v^2 * kappa <= a_lat_max\n        if kappa[i] > 1e-3:\n            v_max_kappa = np.sqrt(a_lat_max / kappa[i])\n        else:\n            v_max_kappa = v_target\n\n        # 2. 走廊寬度限速（若 Corridor 寬度 < 2.0m，強制限制最高速度）\n        corridor_width = corridor_boxes[i][2] - corridor_boxes[i][1]\n        if corridor_width < 2.0:\n            v_max_corridor = v_corridor_limit  # 窄道安全限速\n        else:\n            v_max_corridor = v_target\n\n        # 最終速限取三者的最小值\n        v_max_i = min(v_target, v_max_kappa, v_max_corridor)\n\n        u_osqp[row_idx] = v_max_i ** 2\n        row_idx += 1",
